      "content": "The feeling of being stained by this event is agonizing, but the narrative that you *are* the mistake is a product of your overwhelming pain, not objective fact. While the damage is real, your worth as a person is not defined by your worst action. Allow yourself professional support not to magically erase the past, but to help you navigate this immense grief and find a path forward from the wreckage of your actions.",
      "source": "target",
